   - 针对 Safari 17+ 明确 WebKit 7 天无交互 ITP 存储清理策略，配合温和备份提醒保障资产安全。","dependsOn":["tech-core-architecture"],"evidenceIds":["evidence-vite-static-deploy","evidence-cbcafb3b-0c67-4fa8-a242-6495eae59004"],"id":"deployment-and-build-specification","kind":"deployment","requirementIds":["block-scope-core-boundaries"],"stage":"technical","title":"静态构建打包、本地运行与静态托管部署规范"},{"content":"### 工程基座搭建与 Dexie 存储驱动封装实现任务（技术架构与持久化底座）
